[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6240.55, "timestamp": "01:44:00", "text": "是的。呃，就像如果我因为正在制作它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6243.669, "timestamp": "01:44:03", "text": "现在循环往复，你不会注意到如果什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6246.229, "timestamp": "01:44:06", "text": "装饰品的颜色很合适，所以放在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6247.83, "timestamp": "01:44:07", "text": "方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6249.91, "timestamp": "01:44:09", "text": "这也是明显崩溃的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6252.07, "timestamp": "01:44:12", "text": "要么是因为浏览器源代码，要么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6254.95, "timestamp": "01:44:14", "text": "因为有多个这样的群体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6257.35, "timestamp": "01:44:17", "text": "而我当时应该做这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6259.27, "timestamp": "01:44:19", "text": "分组过多会导致崩溃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6263.27, "timestamp": "01:44:23", "text": "你的文件已损坏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6266.79, "timestamp": "01:44:26", "text": "好的，Alexa，我这就给你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6270.47, "timestamp": "01:44:30", "text": "13号说对了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6274.07, "timestamp": "01:44:34", "text": "13. 什么？什么？哦，是红色的斑点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6290.149, "timestamp": "01:44:50", "text": "是的。你不会注意到它，因为你可以"}]